title: Use Regular Expression in the Search panel finds step_1 or step_2 as whole names, and a pattern that does not compile shows an error and no results instead of a crash
folders: git-history
limit: 50
forbid-log: WARN.*script
forbid-log: script: ignoring
expect-log: search 'step_\(1\|2\)\\b': 3 hits
expect-log: search '\(': 

wait 3000
search-option regex on
search step_(1|2)\b
wait 1500
mark regex-three
wait 450
search (
wait 1200
mark invalid-pattern
wait 450
search [a-
wait 1200
mark invalid-class
wait 450
search-option regex off
search (
wait 1200
mark literal-paren
wait 450
quit
